---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import homeImage from '../content/images/homeImage2.jpg';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="hero-image">
                <Image width={1600} height={1500} src={homeImage} alt="" />
            </div>
			<h2>Welcome to Tahn & Emily's Blog</h2>
			<p>
				With two college degrees (go buffs!) freshly off the press these two have decided to take a pause on their professional careers
				 and take their many talents to a land down under. After a 6 day layover in Taiwan and 5 week stint in Thailand with Tahn's family
				  these young fletchings are venturing out to uncharted territory. Equipped with Work Holiday Visas and a Leatherman these will two
				   will have to fight tooth and claw to survive in the treacherous beach side utopia that is Sydney, Australia. Follow along to see if
				    they can live their Australian dream or if they will end up as a wombat's lunch. 
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
